WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.870
Picture a stone so heavy that
no power at all could lift it.

2
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.430
Could an all-powerful God make it?

3
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.770
If not, there is something God cannot do.

4
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:14.880
But if God could make it, there
is still something God cannot do.

5
00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:16.220
Lift it.

6
00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:19.730
So can God make a stone too heavy to lift?

7
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:21.880
And does it matter?

8
00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:25.420
In this mission, you'll meet
the God of classical theism:

9
00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:29.740
all-powerful, all-knowing,
wholly good and eternal.

10
00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:34.920
Then you'll weigh up what the word cannot
really means when it is said about God.

11
00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:39.460
Your mission: find out whether God
can make a stone too heavy to lift,

12
00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:41.330
and why the answer matters.
